  {
   "id": "DNoxIDXMCAAJ",
   "from": "YiweiZhu",
   "author": "42cf79ec73fc4876",
   "date": "2020-05-18T14:55:39Z",
   "subject": "How to rearrange legends position in phylogenetic tree with multiple associated matrix",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div><span><span>Hi,\r\n everyone!\r\n  I am using ggtree to make a phylogenetic tree with multiple matrix. I \r\nfind the legends are arranged in a column. Since I have multiple matrix \r\nto plot, the legends column is too long. How can the legends be \r\nrearranged in a row? I try the cowplot::get_legend and plot_grid \r\nfunctions. But I cannot shrink the margins between the tree and legends.</span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span>Use the example from the <a href=\"https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html#gheatmap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yulab-smu.github.io/treedata-book/chapter7.html%23gheatmap&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482061133000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ejEWoWD8xtTwsUQAYBxmf\">ggtree manual</a>:<br></span></span></div><span style=\"color:#660\"></span><span style=\"color:#660\"></span><span style=\"color:#000\"></span><br><div><span><span><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">    <br>pp </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> gheatmap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> offset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     <br>   colnames_angle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">90</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> colnames_offset_y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  scale_fill_viridis_c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">option</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;continuous\\nvalue&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">position </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;none&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>leg1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> get_legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">p1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>leg2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> get_legend</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gheatmap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">circ</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> offset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> width</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            colnames_angle</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">90</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> colnames_offset_y </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                     scale_fill_viridis_c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">option</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;A&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;continuous\\nvalue&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>plot_grid</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leg1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leg2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">theme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">background </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> element_rect</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;grey&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><br>the margins between the plot and legends are too large</span></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/8cc352031da0c/Rplot.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Rplot.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"178\"></p><div><span><span><br></span></span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
